.* DEVICE: the task menu for device operations.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='DEVICE'.
:IMPORT NAME=WRKCFGSTS PNLGRP=QHDCCMD1.
:IMPORT NAME=WRKDEVD PNLGRP=QHCFCMD.
:KEYL HELP='KEYS/MENUKEYS' NAME=MENUKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F13 ACTION='MENU INFO'.F13=Information Assistant
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAIN'.F16=System Main menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=DEVICE HELP=HLPDEVICE KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM PANELID=PANELID.Device Operations
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUI HELP=WRKCFGSTS OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD WRKCFGSTS CFGTYPE(*DEV)'.Work with device status
:MENUI HELP=WRKDEVD OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD WRKDEVD DEVD(*DSP)'.Work with displays
:MENUI HELP='DEVICE/OPT3' OPTION=3 ACTION='MENU PRINTER'.Printer
:MENUI HELP='DEVICE/OPT4' OPTION=4 ACTION='MENU TAPE'.Tape
:MENUI HELP='DEVICE/OPT5' OPTION=5 ACTION='MENU DISKETTE'.Diskette
:MENUI HELP='DEVICE/OPT6' OPTION=6 ACTION='MENU CFGPCS'.Configure PC connections
:MENUI HELP='DEVICE/OPT7' OPTION=7 ACTION='MENU OPTICAL'.Optical
:MENUI HELP='DEVICE/OPT70' OPTION=70 ACTION='MENU CMDDEV'.Related commands
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPDEVICE.Device Operations - Help
:P.Displays, printers and storage media: their status and the menus for
each kind of device.
:P.Type an option number or a command and press Enter. F4 prompts the
command, F9 brings the previous one back, F12 returns to the menu shown
before this one.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F4=Prompt
:PD.Prompts the command on the command line, or the command of the
option typed.
:PT.F9=Retrieve
:PD.Puts the last command run back on the command line; press it again
for the one before.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F13=Information Assistant
:PD.Shows menu INFO.
:PT.F16=System Main menu
:PD.Shows menu MAIN.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='DEVICE/OPT3'.Printer
:P.Option 3. Shows menu PRINTER&colon. Printer.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='DEVICE/OPT4'.Tape
:P.Option 4. Shows menu TAPE&colon. Tape.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='DEVICE/OPT5'.Diskette
:P.Option 5. Shows menu DISKETTE&colon. Diskette.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='DEVICE/OPT6'.Configure PC connections
:P.Option 6. Shows menu CFGPCS&colon. Configure PC connections.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='DEVICE/OPT7'.Optical
:P.Option 7. Shows menu OPTICAL&colon. Optical.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='DEVICE/OPT70'.Related commands
:P.Option 70. Shows menu CMDDEV&colon. Related commands.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
